Restore what upstream dropped with split-usr support (v255) for PLD's unmerged /usr:
config lookup in /lib (udev rules, .link, presets), /sbin:/bin in $PATH, ProtectSystem= and
ProtectKernelModules= covering /bin /sbin /lib /lib64 /lib/modules, /lib/kbd keymaps.

